  ('a_60cb281fac6d8f558efaf6dd9fe4dbe4.png', 'decoration', 'Lofi Girl Outfit', 'Lofi Girl', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_60cb281fac6d8f558efaf6dd9fe4dbe4.png', 'a_60cb281fac6d8f558efaf6dd9fe4dbe4', 'The avatar wears Lofi Girl''s signature red scarf while listening to lofi music playing from lofi-branded headphones, mastering the ''chill and cozy'' look.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1309668861620260874", "file": "Lofi_Girl_Outfit.png"}'::jsonb, 348),
  ('a_96f65d0aacc4a94b50ef7fb656d5826d.png', 'decoration', 'Playful Lofi Cat', 'Lofi Girl', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_96f65d0aacc4a94b50ef7fb656d5826d.png', 'a_96f65d0aacc4a94b50ef7fb656d5826d', 'Lofi Girl''s friendly orange cat companion lies happily on its back, hugging your avatar on its belly, eyes closed as it playfully gnaws on your avatar like a chew toy.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1309668861645426729", "file": "Playful_Lofi_Cat.png"}'::jsonb, 349),
  ('a_28fbe43ba1ee217576dee69712bbb628.png', 'decoration', 'Study Session', 'Lofi Girl', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_28fbe43ba1ee217576dee69712bbb628.png', 'a_28fbe43ba1ee217576dee69712bbb628', 'Lofi Girl''s iconic study desk lamp shines its light on a pen scribbling notes onto a notebook. Her red-striped cup filled with pencils sits nearby, all guarded by her loyal moose plushie.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1309668861704146984", "file": "Study_Session.png"}'::jsonb, 350),
  ('a_6649e251a23f24935471ee02c212675b.png', 'decoration', 'Sleepy ChilledCow', 'Lofi Girl', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_6649e251a23f24935471ee02c212675b.png', 'a_6649e251a23f24935471ee02c212675b', 'Lofi Girl''s sleepy cow companion dozes on top of your avatar, orange headphones fitted snugly on its head while snoozing out Zzz''s, probably dreaming of mellow beats.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1309668861674786877", "file": "Sleepy_ChilledCow.png"}'::jsonb, 351),
  ('a_8ad98d25ee4e4512704f759476eeb294.png', 'decoration', 'Group Hug', 'Lofi Girl', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_8ad98d25ee4e4512704f759476eeb294.png', 'a_8ad98d25ee4e4512704f759476eeb294', 'Mochi, Froggy, and Birdie - Lofi Girl''s friendly plushie study companions - hang out excitedly around your avatar while giving big hugs.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1309668861729312898", "file": "Group_Hug.png"}'::jsonb, 352),
  ('a_f081c6b2c85c5ebe5df42f1c24d45bb5.png', 'decoration', 'Bunny Zzzs', 'Kawaii Mode', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_f081c6b2c85c5ebe5df42f1c24d45bb5.png', 'a_f081c6b2c85c5ebe5df42f1c24d45bb5', 'A cuddly pink bunny plopped comfortably atop the avatar is awoken by sounds coming from a nearby matching pink bunny microphone. The bunny frets not and resumes slumber.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1306330662990643252", "file": "Bunny_Zzzs.png"}'::jsonb, 353),
  ('a_5b1319abfc9f928479b68a73635f591d.png', 'decoration', 'Bubble Tea', 'Kawaii Mode', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_5b1319abfc9f928479b68a73635f591d.png', 'a_5b1319abfc9f928479b68a73635f591d', 'The avatar looks as sweet as ever as it sits inside a plastic cup of delicious pink bubble tea filled with vibrant, purple pearls. A brightly colored straw is poked into the top of the lid.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1306330662965477478", "file": "Bubble_Tea.png"}'::jsonb, 354),
