  ('a_993ac691660d3d67b500d995e121b220.png', 'decoration', 'Guile', 'Street Fighter 6', 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatar-decoration-presets/a_993ac691660d3d67b500d995e121b220.png', 'a_993ac691660d3d67b500d995e121b220', 'Guile''s iconic flattop haircut and dog tags decorate the avatar, firing off his powerful sonic attack that creating a ring of energy.', 4100, '{"sku_id": "1285465421167988758", "file": "Guile.png"}'::jsonb, 381),
